<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Your Transportation Co.</title>
  <style>
    body { 
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif; 
      margin: 0; 
      padding: 0; 
      line-height: 1.6; 
      background: #f9f9f9;
    }
    header { 
      background: #2E86C1; 
      color: white; 
      padding: 40px 20px; 
      text-align: center; 
    }
    header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 2.5rem; }
    nav { 
      background: #1B4F72; 
      padding: 10px; 
      text-align: center; 
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
    }
    nav a { 
      color: white; 
      margin: 0 15px; 
      text-decoration: none; 
      font-weight: bold; 
    }
    nav a:hover {
      text-decoration: underline;
    }
    section { 
      padding: 40px 20px; 
      max-width: 900px; 
      margin: auto; 
      background: white;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    h2 { color: #2E86C1; }
    footer { 
      background: #2E86C1; 
      color: white; 
      text-align: center; 
      padding: 20px; 
      margin-top: 20px; 
    }
    .btn { 
      background: #F39C12; 
      color: white; 
      padding: 12px 25px; 
      border: none; 
      border-radius: 5px; 
      cursor: pointer; 
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background: #d68910;
    }
    form {
      display: grid;
      gap: 15px;
    }
    input, textarea {
      padding: 10px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      border: 1px solid #ccc;
      border-radius: 5px;
      width: 100%;
    }
    textarea {
      resize: vertical;
      min-height: 120px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
  <h1>Reliable Event Transportation</h1>
  <p>Your trusted partner for stress-free travel logistics</p>
</header>

<nav>
  <a href="#services">Services</a>
  <a href="#about">About</a>
  <a href="#quote">Request a Quote</a>
  <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
</nav>

<section id="services">
  <h2>Our Services</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Shuttle & Charter Coordination</li>
    <li>Corporate Event Transportation</li>
    <li>Private Group Transport</li>
    <li>VIP & Luxury Options</li>
  </ul>
</section>

<section id="about">
  <h2>About Us</h2>
  <p>
    We work with top transportation providers and handle all the coordination,
    ensuring your event runs on time and stress-free. With exceptional customer 
    service, we go beyond just booking — we make sure every detail is covered.
  </p>
</section>

<section id="quote">
  <h2>Request a Quote</h2>
  <form action="https://formspree.io/f/mwkgbjqd" method="POST">
    <input type="text" name="name" placeholder="Your Name" required>
    <input type="email" name="_replyto" placeholder="Your Email" required>
    <input type="text" name="event" placeholder="Event Type (e.g. wedding, corporate)">
    <textarea name="message" placeholder="Tell us about your transportation needs..." required></textarea>
    <button class="btn" type="submit">Send Request</button>
  </form>
</section>

<section id="contact">
  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Email: info@yourcompany.com</p>
  <p>Phone: (555) 123-4567</p>
</section>

<footer>
  <p>&copy; 2025 Your Transportation Co. | All rights reserved</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
